WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.035 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Now, more than ever,
it's important to remember

00:00:02.035 --> 00:00:03.303 align:start size:94% position:6%
there are two sides
to every news story.

00:00:03.303 --> 00:00:06.106
To make sure you get to see
important issues from all sides,

00:00:06.106 --> 00:00:06.940 line:92%
we've invited two of our writers

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:08.742 align:start size:94% position:6%
who have very different
points of view,

00:00:08.742 --> 00:00:10.343 align:start size:94% position:6%
and we will examine
their opinions

00:00:10.343 --> 00:00:13.646 size:78% position:39%
in a segment we call
"Point/Counterpoint."

00:00:13.646 --> 00:00:18.685 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:00:18.685 --> 00:00:22.088 align:start size:94% position:6%
Ally, Amber, thank you so much
for being here today.

00:00:22.088 --> 00:00:23.656 align:start size:94% position:6%
Let's get started.
First topic.

00:00:23.656 --> 00:00:27.360 align:start size:94% position:6%
President Trump has nominated
Judge Brett Kavanaugh

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:31.064
to replace retired Supreme Court
Justice Anthony Kennedy.

00:00:31.064 --> 00:00:32.499 line:92%
Could his appointment threaten

00:00:32.499 --> 00:00:34.334 align:start size:94% position:6%
historic civil-rights
precedents?

00:00:34.334 --> 00:00:36.669 align:start size:94% position:6%
Ally.
-Of course it will.

00:00:36.669 --> 00:00:38.038 line:92%
If he's confirmed, Roe v. Wade

00:00:38.038 --> 00:00:40.040 align:start size:94% position:6%
will be the first thing
out the window.

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:41.708 align:start size:94% position:6%
Women have a better chance
of finding a unicorn

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:44.811
then a Republican who will
stand up for their rights.

00:00:44.811 --> 00:00:48.748 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Amber.
-I love unicorns!

00:00:48.748 --> 00:00:49.649 size:75% position:38% line:92%
If I ever found one,

00:00:49.649 --> 00:00:53.853
I would ride it everywhere
I went, even on the subway!

00:00:53.853 --> 00:00:55.555 align:start size:94% position:6%
Ooh, and I'd name
my unicorn Paul,

00:00:55.555 --> 00:00:58.658 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause you can't be all flashy
all the time.

00:00:58.658 --> 00:00:59.592 size:75% position:38% line:92%
We'd be inseparable.

00:00:59.592 --> 00:01:02.929
People would be like, "Amber
and Paul came over last night.

00:01:02.929 --> 00:01:05.865 line:92%
They ate all my sugar cubes!"

00:01:05.865 --> 00:01:06.833 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.833 --> 00:01:10.136 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Another great point.
Next topic.

00:01:10.136 --> 00:01:11.571 line:92%
Despite clear intelligence

00:01:11.571 --> 00:01:14.407
that Russia interfered with our
election and stole voter data,

00:01:14.407 --> 00:01:16.242 align:start size:94% position:6%
Trump met with Vladimir Putin
in Helsinki.

00:01:16.242 --> 00:01:19.245
What, if anything, was achieved
by this meeting? Ally.

00:01:19.245 --> 00:01:21.681 align:start size:94% position:6%
-He legitimized a dictator
on the world stage,

00:01:21.681 --> 00:01:24.250
didn't reproach Russia
for hacking our election,

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:26.519 size:75% position:38%
and is helping Putin
by weakening NATO.

00:01:26.519 --> 00:01:30.557 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's very clear Trump
is absolutely Putin's puppet.

00:01:30.557 --> 00:01:33.760 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Amber?
-I love puppets.

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:37.464 align:start size:94% position:6%
Honestly, I think it's
the most overlooked art form.

00:01:37.464 --> 00:01:38.798 line:92%
Your hand becomes a person.

00:01:38.798 --> 00:01:41.935
[ High-pitched ] And your
voice turns into this!

00:01:41.935 --> 00:01:43.470 line:92%
-I said Trump is Putin's puppet.

00:01:43.470 --> 00:01:45.238 align:start size:94% position:6%
What do you think about that
specifically?

00:01:45.238 --> 00:01:48.241 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Normal voice ] Ooh,
I wish a person was my puppet.

00:01:48.241 --> 00:01:49.776 line:92%
That would be so much fun.

00:01:49.776 --> 00:01:51.244 line:92%
Hey, Seth, move your lips.

00:01:51.244 --> 00:01:53.313 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ High-pitched ]
"Hey, my name is Seth Meyers!

00:01:53.313 --> 00:01:55.248 line:92%
And I want all the jelly beans!"

00:01:55.248 --> 00:01:58.451 size:88% position:44%
-Seth, what's she saying
is completely off-topic.

00:01:58.451 --> 00:02:00.053 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Ally, it's called
"Point/Counterpoint."

00:02:00.053 --> 00:02:02.689
You get to make a point, she
gets to make the counterpoint.

00:02:02.689 --> 00:02:04.691 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But doesn't her counterpoint
have to make sense?

00:02:04.691 --> 00:02:08.828
-"No, it doesn't have to
make sense at all! Next topic."

00:02:08.828 --> 00:02:13.666 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:13.666 --> 00:02:17.871
-The Trump administration wants
to end environmental protections

00:02:17.871 --> 00:02:18.905 line:92%
that would directly threaten

00:02:18.905 --> 00:02:20.406 align:start size:94% position:6%
animals on the
endangered-species list.

00:02:20.406 --> 00:02:23.676 align:start size:94% position:6%
Are we looking at
further extinctions? Ally.

00:02:23.676 --> 00:02:24.978 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Of course we are!

00:02:24.978 --> 00:02:25.945 line:92%
Though, if we're being honest,

00:02:25.945 --> 00:02:27.413 align:start size:94% position:6%
with Trump encouraging
climate change,

00:02:27.413 --> 00:02:29.516 align:start size:94% position:6%
we're looking at human
extinction pretty soon, too.

00:02:29.516 --> 00:02:32.385
So, sure, why not? Wipe out
innocent animals firsts.

00:02:32.385 --> 00:02:34.287 align:start size:94% position:6%
And to think, Trump's
probably just doing this

00:02:34.287 --> 00:02:36.256 align:start size:94% position:6%
for his gun-horny sons
who love paying

00:02:36.256 --> 00:02:38.358 align:start size:94% position:6%
to hunt big-game trophies.
[ Scoffs ]

00:02:38.358 --> 00:02:41.227 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Amber?
-I love trophies.

00:02:41.227 --> 00:02:45.398 align:start size:94% position:6%
A little golden man is telling
you, "You did a good job."

00:02:45.398 --> 00:02:47.367 line:92%
And he's bowling just like me!

00:02:47.367 --> 00:02:50.236 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I like that
you have to earn them.

00:02:50.236 --> 00:02:51.538 size:88% position:44% line:92%
You can't just buy them.

00:02:51.538 --> 00:02:54.407 line:92%
Unless you buy them, which I do!

00:02:54.407 --> 00:02:55.475 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:55.475 --> 00:02:56.576 line:92%
Hey, this is for you, Ally.

00:02:56.576 --> 00:03:01.214
It says "Best Point"
'cause you have the best point.

00:03:02.015 --> 00:03:04.851
-If you think I got you a trophy
for Best Counterpoint,

00:03:04.851 --> 00:03:05.952 size:88% position:44% line:92%
you are sorely mistaken.

00:03:05.952 --> 00:03:09.289 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Good!
'Cause I got myself one!

00:03:09.289 --> 00:03:12.225 align:start size:94% position:6%
Way to go, Amber!
Thank you.

00:03:12.225 --> 00:03:14.627 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:03:14.627 --> 00:03:15.528 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Next topic.

00:03:15.528 --> 00:03:17.997
Despite federal judges ordering
the Trump administration

00:03:17.997 --> 00:03:19.666 align:start size:94% position:6%
to reunite separated families
at the border,

00:03:19.666 --> 00:03:22.368
hundreds of children remain
in detention centers alone.

00:03:22.368 --> 00:03:24.504 align:start size:94% position:6%
How do we fix this disaster?
Ally.

00:03:24.504 --> 00:03:26.873 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Honestly, I just wish
we could all exist

00:03:26.873 --> 00:03:28.341 align:start size:94% position:6%
in the alternate reality
where Hillary won

00:03:28.341 --> 00:03:30.777 align:start size:94% position:6%
and we're not dealing with
daily human-rights violations,

00:03:30.777 --> 00:03:33.313 align:start size:94% position:6%
that I wouldn't be so upset
all the time.

00:03:33.313 --> 00:03:35.515 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:35.515 --> 00:03:38.952 line:92%
-Wow! Cool! A happy Ally?

00:03:38.952 --> 00:03:42.455 align:start size:94% position:6%
Huh. I want to live in
that alternate reality, too.

00:03:42.455 --> 00:03:44.157 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, but how do we
make that happen?

00:03:44.157 --> 00:03:47.660 align:start size:94% position:6%
-My magical unicorn, Paul.
He'll grant our wish.

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:51.731 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Laughs giddily ]
Your wish is granted!

00:03:51.731 --> 00:03:53.066 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Snorts ]

00:03:53.066 --> 00:03:59.172 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Harp plays ]

00:03:59.172 --> 00:04:01.908 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:05.778 --> 00:04:07.680 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Next topic.

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:10.850 align:start size:94% position:6%
Which are better --
cookies or brownies? Ally?

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:12.785 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Brownies are better
than cookies,

00:04:12.785 --> 00:04:15.054 align:start size:94% position:6%
and anyone who disagrees
is a monster!

00:04:15.054 --> 00:04:18.858
-Cookies are my favorite!
-Then you are a monster!

00:04:18.858 --> 00:04:20.326 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Ally, I thought
when Hillary won,

00:04:20.326 --> 00:04:24.197 align:start size:94% position:6%
you'd be less upset
about every-- [Laughs]

00:04:24.197 --> 00:04:28.001 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:28.001 --> 00:04:29.669 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Have you met me?

00:04:29.669 --> 00:04:34.841 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:34.841 --> 00:04:42.582 line:92%
[ Unicorn laughing, sobbing ]

00:04:42.582 --> 00:04:44.651 line:92%
It's so -- It's so funny.

00:04:44.651 --> 00:04:49.022 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This has been another great
"Point/Counterpoint."

